---
import IllustrationFigure from "~/components/illustration-kit/IllustrationFigure.astro"
import SvgFigure from "~/components/illustration-kit/SvgFigure.astro"
---

<IllustrationFigure lead="Two bus gaps, repeating">
  <SvgFigure
    name="inspection"
    class="mx-auto w-full max-w-sm"
    viewBox="0 0 300 156"
    title="A five-minute gap followed by a fifteen-minute gap"
    desc="Buses arrive at zero, five and twenty minutes. A random arrival falls in the short gap one quarter of the time, and in the long gap three quarters of the time. The average bus gap is ten minutes, but the average passenger wait is 6.25 minutes."
  >
    <g fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5">
      <path d="M15 50 H285" />
      <path d="M15 40 V60 M82.5 40 V60 M285 40 V60" />
    </g>
    <g fill="currentColor" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="16" text-anchor="middle">
      <text x="15" y="28">
        0
      </text>
      <text x="82.5" y="28">
        5
      </text>
      <text x="296" y="28" text-anchor="end">
        20 min
      </text>
    </g>
    <rect
      x="15"
      y="72"
      width="67.5"
      height="40"
      fill="var(--color-series-blue)"
      opacity="0.25"
    />
    <rect
      x="82.5"
      y="72"
      width="202.5"
      height="40"
      fill="var(--color-series-red)"
      opacity="0.25"
    />
    <path
      d="M15 72 H285 M15 112 H285 M15 72 V112 M82.5 72 V112 M285 72 V112"
      fill="none"
      stroke="currentColor"
      stroke-width="1.5"
    />
    <g fill="currentColor" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="16" text-anchor="middle">
      <text x="48.8" y="98" font-weight="bold">
        5 min
      </text>
      <text x="183.8" y="98" font-weight="bold">
        15 min
      </text>
      <text x="48.8" y="140">
        25%
      </text>
      <text x="183.8" y="140">
        75% of arrival times
      </text>
    </g>
  </SvgFigure>
  <Fragment slot="caption">
    The gaps average 10 minutes, so half the average gap is 5 minutes. But a person arriving at
    a random moment is three times as likely to land in the long gap. Their average wait is 6.25
    minutes, not 5.
  </Fragment>
</IllustrationFigure>
